              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakela neyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi nakwiŋiji dehi mwituŋa diwukuyanakuheta, nkisu wakayisha hampidi yaGerizimi, ishiŋu wakadisha hampidi yaEbali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hijidi kwishinadi daYodana kumbadi yanjila yaya kwahuminaŋa itaŋwa, mwituŋa dawaKenani ashakama muChana kwatalaŋana naGiligali, kwakwihi nanyikula yaMoreku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa enu keŋa muzambuki Yodana, mwiŋili nakuheta ituŋa dakuyinkayi Yehova Nzambi yenu, ninodumwakadiheta, mwakashakamamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakashaŋaku muchima wakwilanimuyidika yejima nimuwuŋaji wunukuyishila kumesu enu lelu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.32",
